{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pooping Cat is a chill and adorable idle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just type on your computer \u2014 replying to messages, writing code, or even\u2026doing nothing? \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the little cat on your screen will drop tiny poops everywhere, turning your desktop into a litter box and piling up a mountain of poop! \ud83d\udca9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/6c3154fba472e762adc6c4f1f6ba5bf1.webp?t=1762227055\" width=70 height=56 /></span>Poops stack up automatically, treasure chests drop on their own, and opening them unlocks all kinds of skins and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/65f8d3390a9e4553ab01abd8ec868a5a.poster.avif?t=1762227055\" width=162 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/65f8d3390a9e4553ab01abd8ec868a5a.webm?t=1762227055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/4b083ea51701baf36e2afb09301fe419.poster.avif?t=1762227055\" width=164 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/4b083ea51701baf36e2afb09301fe419.webm?t=1762227055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/0429d53b7137e68784d9588a21ee08e5.poster.avif?t=1762227055\" width=162 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/0429d53b7137e68784d9588a21ee08e5.webm?t=1762227055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/8dee1162a12a7cf7de3a1066d265d82a.avif?t=1762227055\" width=70 height=64 /></span>Special poops may appear at random \u2014 rarer, weirder, and worth more points \u2014 to surprise you throughout the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/77fbd0b507da58e8fe3b959019a469e5.avif?t=1762227055\" width=120 height=170 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/90e1891a6bcefd96663a45253493bcc3.avif?t=1762227055\" width=120 height=170 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/d2add9ee3de16fe1e1b34cd2153be361.avif?t=1762227055\" width=120 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834740/extras/8aabd479852bae118f16f954acc65377.avif?t=1762227055\" width=70 height=70 /></span>You can even invite your friends for a synchronized pooping session: create a room and watch the chaos unfold together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item